  <item>
    <title>2026 的第一颗粉红泡泡 🏳️‍🌈㊙️</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6981f449e3b98bb2defda312</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6981f449e3b98bb2defda312</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Feb 2026 13:15:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>跟我一起吹起2026年的第一颗粉红泡泡 😉</span></p><span></span><p><span>“感觉到了吗？就是这么喜欢你。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“不可以在佛祖面前这样。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“这是我男朋友。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“只要我们在一起的时候，你别当我面跟别人搞在一起就行了。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“我试试。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>将将将~花絮，我把文字稿发给deepseek让生成的语句描写:</span></p><span></span><h3><strong><span>角色设定</span></strong></h3><span></span><p><strong><span>1. 基础形象：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>体型</span></strong><span>：高挑挺拔，宽肩窄腰，典型的运动系倒三角身材，肌肉线条流畅但不夸张。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>年龄</span></strong><span>：约25-30岁，面容带有少年感的锐利，但眼神略带慵懒世故。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>2. 面部特征：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>发型</span></strong><span>：黑色短碎发，略带汗湿的随意感，额前有几缕不羁的刘海。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>五官</span></strong><span>：眉骨立体，眼睛偏细长，笑起来眼角微垂显得有点“憨”，但平时看人时带着直白的侵略性（有点坏）。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>标志细节</span></strong><span>：左侧脸颊或颧骨上贴着一块方形创可贴，是角色的视觉记忆点。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>3. 服饰风格（关键造型）：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>上衣</span></strong><span>：修身的深色运动长袖衫（凸显肩臂线条），材质略显弹性。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>下装</span></strong><span>：极短的牛仔或运动短裤，露出修长结实的大腿。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>鞋</span></strong><span>：简约的黑色运动鞋或短靴。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>氛围</span></strong><span>：整体穿着与曼谷酒吧环境形成反差，突出他“不拘常规”的气质。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>4. 神态与动作参考：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>经典姿态</span></strong><span>：一手随意插兜，另一手持酒杯，身体微侧看向镜头，嘴角带笑。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>场景建议</span></strong><span>：</span><br><span>酒吧暖色灯光下，举杯瞬间的眼神特写。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>几轮调整后 豆包有点东西啊！哈哈哈 大概看个意思吧哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuvYP_CE6793dfvxxhBE1YM4ur_t.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>那份忘不了的爱心砂锅粥</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FomiBV3zioMVyOF6ymnIRT7RlgwM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>半小时就麻利做好的五菜一汤</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvQCZ-q4GGqllG8gdGNvtM1v1zjt.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
